All experiments were conducted on a Linux server equipped with dual Intel Xeon Silver 4210R processors, 376 GB RAM, and 4 NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3090 GPUs with 24 GB memory each. The software environment was based on Python 3.10.12, PyTorch 2.0.1, and CUDA 11.8. ESM-2 (esm2_t12_35M_UR50D) was used as the default sequence encoder [36]. Models were trained with AdamW using an initial learning rate of \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
